<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Mobile App — Carbon</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; background: #141514; color: #fff; font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .wrap { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h1 { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    p.subtitle { color: #8A8D90; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 32px; }

    .stats { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .stat { flex: 1; min-width: 140px; background: #1C1D1C; border: 1px solid #2E302F; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; }
    .stat .num { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #D6362F; }
    .stat .label { color: #8A8D90; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }

    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .card {
      background: #1C1D1C; border: 1px solid #2E302F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px;
      text-decoration: none; color: #fff; display: block; position: relative;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .card:hover { border-color: #D6362F; }
    .icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; background: #D6362F;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 17px; }
    .card p { margin: 0; color: #8A8D90; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .badge {
      position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 18px; background: #D6362F; color: #fff;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .branch-links { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .branch-links a {
      flex: 1; text-align: center; background: #26282A; border: 1px solid #2E302F; color: #fff;
      padding: 8px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;
    }
    .branch-links a:hover { border-color: #D6362F; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Mobile App</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Everything related to the Carbon member app, in one place.</p>

    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="num"><%= appUserCount %></div>
        <div class="label">Members with app installed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="num"><%= pendingCount %></div>
        <div class="label">Pending package requests</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="num"><%= newsCount %></div>
        <div class="label">Updates posted</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📷</div>
        <h3>Front Desk Check-In QR</h3>
        <p>The rotating QR code members scan to check in when they arrive.</p>
        <div class="branch-links">
          <a href="/attendance/desk/CFC" target="_blank">Open CFC</a>
          <a href="/attendance/desk/Sheraton" target="_blank">Open Sheraton</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a class="card" href="/package-requests">
        <% if (pendingCount > 0) { %><span class="badge"><%= pendingCount %> pending</span><% } %>
        <div class="icon">📦</div>
        <h3>Package Requests</h3>
        <p>Approve or decline package requests members send from the app — activates their subscription instantly.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="/news-admin">
        <div class="icon">🔔</div>
        <h3>Post an Update</h3>
        <p>Post news to the app's Updates feed, with an option to also send it as a push notification.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="/admin-tools/run-inactivity-check">
        <div class="icon">💤</div>
        <h3>Inactivity Reminders</h3>
        <p>Runs automatically every day at 9am — members who haven't checked in for 7+ days get a nudge. Click to run it manually now.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
